{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"yaoci-e-o044","title":"东莱郡与州有隙、曲直未分而以先闻为善，时州章已去，郡守恐后，求可使者，太史慈年二十一以选行","accounts":[{"id":"yaoci-a-8585d2dbdc3e439f9bc9","label":"正文","text":"东莱郡与州有隙、曲直未分而以先闻为善，时州章已去，郡守恐后，求可使者，太史慈年二十一以选行","evidence":["yaoci-q-213d417f66fb48b9c133"]},{"id":"yaoci-a-5a2b0ab4e5db6d8f89fb","label":"正文","text":"太史慈晨夜取道到洛阳，诣公车门，见州吏始欲求通","evidence":["yaoci-q-ccbedccaee2fc33ab35a"]},{"id":"yaoci-a-dad9d0c5281c8ff46f45","label":"正文","text":"太史慈以怀刀截败州吏所取之州章","evidence":["yaoci-q-e55b678e4efff85a6e73"]},{"id":"yaoci-a-98f23e6386b1f54c0d37","label":"正文","text":"太史慈晓谕州吏俱去避罪，即日俱去","evidence":["yaoci-q-bfdedce0678a4c840fdc"]},{"id":"yaoci-a-e995fb96ee0e793c2e73","label":"正文","text":"太史慈与州吏既出城，因遁还，通郡章","evidence":["yaoci-q-79afe8d60b689b1c3ff0"]},{"id":"yaoci-a-4bf505115a0aa2d37234","label":"正文","text":"州家闻之更遣吏通章，有司以格章之故不复见理，州受其短","evidence":["yaoci-q-be80f79ae9ca65bd3b24"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0003","role":"以选行者；到洛阳者；截章者；晓谕者；遁还通章者","evidence":["yaoci-q-213d417f66fb48b9c133","yaoci-q-ccbedccaee2fc33ab35a","yaoci-q-e55b678e4efff85a6e73","yaoci-q-bfdedce0678a4c840fdc","yaoci-q-79afe8d60b689b1c3ff0"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["yaoci-q-213d417f66fb48b9c133","yaoci-q-ccbedccaee2fc33ab35a","yaoci-q-e55b678e4efff85a6e73","yaoci-q-bfdedce0678a4c840fdc","yaoci-q-79afe8d60b689b1c3ff0","yaoci-q-be80f79ae9ca65bd3b24"]},"ordering_evidence":"yaoci-q-213d417f66fb48b9c133","source_order":[49,85,29],"order":8960}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0003","name":"太史慈","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yaoci-q-213d417f66fb48b9c133","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-9b9ec45e700ed9cfc256","layer":"original","quote":"会郡与州有隙，曲直未分，以先闻者为善〖3〗。时州章已去〖4〗，郡守恐后之，求可使者；慈年二十一，以选行","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":29,"end":80},{"id":"yaoci-q-79afe8d60b689b1c3ff0","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-525078b153df0f23e54d","layer":"original","quote":"慈既与出城，因遁还，通郡章","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13},{"id":"yaoci-q-be80f79ae9ca65bd3b24","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-525078b153df0f23e54d","layer":"original","quote":"州家闻之〖18〗，更遣吏通章；有司以格章之故，不复见理〖19〗：州受其短","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":14,"end":50},{"id":"yaoci-q-bfdedce0678a4c840fdc","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-f059030f102c600fa2ba","layer":"original","quote":"慈将至车间〖10〗，与语曰：“向使君不以章相与〖11〗，吾亦无因得败之；是为吉凶祸福等耳〖12〗，吾不独受此罪。岂若默然俱出去〖13〗，可以存易亡〖14〗；无事俱就刑辟〖15〗！”吏言：“君为郡败吾章，已得如意，欲复亡为〖16〗？”慈答曰：“初受郡遣，但来视章通与未耳。吾用意太过，乃相败章；今还，亦恐以此见谴怒〖17〗：故俱欲去尔。”吏然慈言，即日俱去","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":130,"end":307},{"id":"yaoci-q-ccbedccaee2fc33ab35a","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-f059030f102c600fa2ba","layer":"original","quote":"晨夜取道，到洛阳；诣公车门","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13},{"id":"yaoci-q-e55b678e4efff85a6e73","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-f059030f102c600fa2ba","layer":"original","quote":"慈已先怀刀，便截败之","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":98,"end":108}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
